        : 'This tag was actually used in the current statistical or time-series analysis and returned non-null historical data.';
    } else if (directlyUsable) {
      note = isZh
        ? '本轮用途：数据库目录说明与所需变量一致，并已读取到非空历史记录，已纳入本轮可用输入。'
